<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<section xmlns="http://cnx.rice.edu/cnxml" xmlns:m="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" id="fs-id1170655150800" xml:lang="jv-Latn-ID"><title>Ayo Nganggo Variabel lan Tandha Aljabar</title><para id="fs-id1170654957487">Tandha panglumpukan ing aljabar kuwi mèmper karo koma, titik loro, lan tandha wacan liyane ing basa Indonesia. Tandha iki nggawe cetha wujud aljabar endi sing kudu diklumpukake lan dipisahake saka wujud liyane. Saiki ayo kenal telung jinise.</para>
<note id="fs-id1170655219760">
<title>Tandha Panglumpukan</title>
<equation id="fs-id1167269979347" class="unnumbered"><label /><m:math><m:mrow><m:mtable><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mtext>Kurung biasa</m:mtext></m:mtd><m:mtd /><m:mtd /><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mspace width="0.15em" /><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo><m:mrow /><m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mtext>Kurung siku</m:mtext></m:mtd><m:mtd /><m:mtd /><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mspace width="0.15em" /><m:mrow><m:mo>[</m:mo><m:mrow /><m:mo>]</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mtext>Kurung kurawal</m:mtext></m:mtd><m:mtd /><m:mtd /><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mrow><m:mo>{</m:mo><m:mrow /><m:mo>}</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mtd></m:mtr></m:mtable></m:mrow></m:math></equation>
</note>
<para id="fs-id1170654880176">Iki sawetara tuladha wujud aljabar sing nganggo <term class="no-emphasis" id="term-00011">tandha panglumpukan</term>. Mengko ing subbab iki, ayo ngowahi wujud kaya ngene dadi luwih prasaja.</para>
<equation id="fs-id1170654936322" class="unnumbered"><label /><m:math><m:mrow><m:mtable><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>14</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo></m:mtd><m:mtd /><m:mtd /><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mn>21</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">[</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">]</m:mo></m:mtd><m:mtd /><m:mtd /><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mn>24</m:mn><m:mo>÷</m:mo><m:mo>{</m:mo><m:mn>13</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">[</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>6</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">]</m:mo><m:mo>}</m:mo></m:mtd></m:mtr></m:mtable></m:mrow></m:math></equation>
<para id="fs-id1166424830424"><newline /></para>
</section>
